<title>CANADA: Devtek to sell Interfast holding.</title>
<headline>Devtek to sell Interfast holding.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Devtek Corp said on Friday it signed a letter of intent to sell its stake in Interfast Inc to the president of Interfast.</p>
<p>The sale will reduce Devtek liabilities and debt by about C$11 million. Interfast distributes fasteners and tools to the aerospace and industrial markets.</p>
<p>Devtek said the sale is part of its strategy to focus on being an international developer and manufacturer of systems and components for the automotive, aerospace and telecommunications markets.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
